{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-26-1","title":"Acts 26:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul, in the presence of Agrippa, declares his life from his childhood; 12 and how miraculously he was converted, and called to his apostleship. 24 Festus charges him with being mad, whereunto he answers modestly. 28 Agrippa is almost persuaded to be a Christian. 31 The whole company pronounce him innocent.</p>\n<p>Thou. 25:16; Pr 18:13,17; Joh 7:51 stretched. Pr 1:24; Eze 16:27; Ro 10:21 answered. 2; 22:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-3","title":"Acts 26:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>because. 26; 6:14; 21:21; 24:10; 25:19,20,26; 28:17; De 17:18; 1Co 13:2 to hear. 24:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-4","title":"Acts 26:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>manner. 2Ti 3:10 which. 22:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-5","title":"Acts 26:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>if. 22:5 that. 23:6; Php 3:5,6 sect. 24:5,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-6","title":"Acts 26:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>am. 8; 23:6; 24:15,21; 28:20 the promise. 3:24; 13:32,33; Ge 3:15; 12:3; 22:18; 26:4; 49:10; De 18:15 2Sa 7:12,13; Job 19:25-27; Ps 2:6-12; 40:6-8; 98:2; 110:1-4 Ps 132:11,17; Isa 4:2; 7:14; 9:6,7; 11:1-5; 40:9-11; 42:1-4; 53:10-12 Isa 61:1-3; Jer 23:5,6; 33:14-17; Eze 17:22-24; 21:27; 34:23-25 Eze 37:24; Da 2:34,35,44,45; 7:13,14; 9:24-26; Ho 3:5; Joe 2:32 Am 9:11,12; Ob 1:21; Mic 5:2; 7:20; Zep 3:14-17; Zec 2:10,11; 6:12; 9:9 Zec 13:1,7; Mal 3:1; 4:2; Lu 1:69,70; Ro 15:8; Ga 3:17,18; 4:4 Tit 2:13; 1Pe 1:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-7","title":"Acts 26:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>our. Ezr 6:17; 8:35; Mt 19:28; Lu 22:30; Jas 1:1; Re 7:4-8 instantly. 20:31; Ps 134:1,2; 135:2; Lu 2:36,37; 1Th 3:10; 1Ti 5:5 day and night. Gr. night and day. hope. Lu 2:25,38; 7:19,20; Php 3:11 For. 6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-8","title":"Acts 26:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>4:2; 10:40-42; 13:30,31; 17:31,32; 25:19; Ge 18:14; Mt 22:29-32 Lu 1:37; 18:27; Joh 5:28,29; 1Co 15:12-20; Php 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-9","title":"Acts 26:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that. Joh 16:2,3; Ro 10:2; Ga 1:13,14; Php 3:6; 1Ti 1:13 the name. 3:6; 9:16; 21:13; 22:8; 24:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-10","title":"Acts 26:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I also. 7:58; 8:1,3; 9:13,26; 22:4,19,20; 1Co 15:9; Ga 1:13 the saints. 9:32,41; Ps 16:3; Ro 15:25,26; Eph 1:1; Re 17:6 having. 9:14,21; 22:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-11","title":"Acts 26:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I punished. 22:19; Mt 10:17; Mr 13:9; Lu 21:12 compelled. 13:45; 18:6; Mr 3:28; Heb 10:28,29; Jas 2:7 mad. 24,25; Ec 9:3; Lu 6:11; 15:17; 2Pe 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-12","title":"Acts 26:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>as. 9:1,2; 22:5 with. 10; 1Ki 21:8-10; Ps 94:20,21; Isa 10:1; Jer 26:8; 29:26,27 Joh 7:45-48; 11:57</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-13","title":"Acts 26:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>mid-day. 9:3; 22:6 above. Isa 24:23; 30:26; Mt 17:2; Re 1:16; 21:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-14","title":"Acts 26:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>in. 21:40; 22:2 Saul. 9:4,5; 22:7-9 hard. Pr 13:15; Zec 2:8; 12:2; 1Co 10:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-15","title":"Acts 26:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I am. Ex 16:8; Mt 25:40,45; Joh 15:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-16","title":"Acts 26:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>rise. 9:6-9; 22:10 to make. 9:15,16; 13:1-4; 22:14,15 a minister. 1:17,25; 6:4; 20:24; 21:19; Ro 1:5; 15:16; 2Co 4:1; 5:18; Eph 3:7,8 Col 1:7,23,25; 1Th 3:2; 1Ti 1:12; 4:6; 2Ti 4:5 in the. 18:9,10; 22:17-21; 23:11; 27:23,24; 2Co 12:1-7; Ga 1:12; 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-17","title":"Acts 26:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Delivering. 9:23-25,29,30; 13:50; 14:5,6,19,20; 16:39; 17:10,14; 18:10,12-16 Ac 19:28-41; 21:28-36; 22:21,22; 23:10-24; 25:3,9-11; 27:42-44 Ps 34:19; 37:32,33; 2Co 1:8-10; 4:8-10; 11:23-26; 2Ti 3:11; 4:16,17 the Gentiles. 9:15; 22:21; 28:28; Ro 11:13; 15:16; Ga 2:9; Eph 3:7,8; 1Ti 2:7 2Ti 1:11; 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-18","title":"Acts 26:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>open. 9:17,18; Ps 119:18; 146:8; Isa 29:18; 32:3; 35:5; 42:7; 43:8; Lu 4:18 Lu 24:45; Joh 9:39; 2Co 4:4,6; Eph 1:18 and to. 23; 13:47; Isa 9:2; 49:6; 60:1-3; Mal 4:2; Mt 4:16; 6:22,23; Lu 1:79 Lu 2:32; Joh 1:4-9; 3:19; 8:12; 9:5; 12:35,36; 2Co 4:6; 6:14; Eph 1:18 Eph 4:18; 5:8,14; 1Th 5:4-8; 1Pe 2:9,25; 1Jo 2:8,9 and from. Isa 49:24,25; 53:8-12; Lu 11:21,22; Col 1:13; 2Ti 2:26; Heb 2:14,15 1Jo 3:8; 5:19; 1Pe 2:9; Re 20:2,3 that they. 2:38; 3:19; 5:31; 10:43; 13:38,39; Ps 32:1,2; Lu 1:77; 24:47; Ro 4:6-9 1Co 6:10,11; Eph 1:7; Col 1:14; 1Jo 1:9; 2:12 inheritance. 20:32; Ro 8:17; Eph 1:11,14; Col 1:12; Heb 9:15; Jas 2:5; 1Pe 1:4 sanctified. 20:32; Joh 17:17; 1Co 1:2,30; 6:11; Tit 3:5,6; Heb 10:10,14; Jude 1:1 Re 21:27 faith. 15:9; Joh 4:10,14; 7:38,39; Ro 5:1,2; Ga 2:20; 3:2,14; Eph 2:8 Heb 11:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-19","title":"Acts 26:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>O king. 2,26,27 I was not. Ex 4:13,14; Isa 50:5; Jer 20:9; Eze 2:7,8; 3:14; Jon 1:3; Ga 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-20","title":"Acts 26:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>first. 9:19-22; 11:26-30 and at. 9:28,29; 22:17,18 and then. 17; 13:46-48; 14:16-21; 22:21,22; Ro 11:18-20 repent. 2:38; 3:19; 11:18; 17:30; 20:21; Jer 31:19,20; Eze 18:30-32; Mt 3:2 Mt 4:17; 9:13; 21:30-32; Mr 6:12; Lu 13:3,5; 15:7,10; 24:46,47 Ro 2:4; 2Co 7:10; 2Ti 2:25,26; Re 2:5,21; 3:3; 16:11 turn. 9:35; 14:15; 15:19; Ps 22:27; La 3:40; Ho 12:6; 14:2; Lu 1:16 2Co 3:16; 1Th 1:9 and do. Isa 55:7; Mt 3:8; Lu 3:8-14; 19:8,9; Eph 4:17-32; 5:1-25; 6:1-9 Tit 2:2-13; 1Pe 1:14-16; 2:9-12; 4:2-5; 2Pe 1:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-21","title":"Acts 26:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the Jews. 21:30,31; 22:22; 23:12-15; 25:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-22","title":"Acts 26:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>obtained. 17; 14:19,20;