End":28},"content":"<p>Almost. 29; 24:25; Eze 33:31; Mt 10:18; Mr 6:20; 10:17-22; 2Co 4:2 Jas 1:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-29","title":"Acts 26:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>I would. Ex 16:3; Nu 11:29; 2Sa 18:33; 2Ki 5:3; 1Co 4:8; 7:7; 2Co 11:1 that not. Jer 13:17; Lu 19:41,42; Joh 5:34; Ro 9:1-3; 10:1; Col 1:28 except. 12:6; 25:14; Eph 6:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-30","title":"Acts 26:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>the king. 18:15; 28:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-31","title":"Acts 26:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>This man. 23:9,29; 25:25; 28:18; 2Sa 24:17; Lu 23:4,14,15; 1Pe 3:16; 4:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-26-32","title":"Acts 26:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>appealed. 25:11,12,25; 28:18</p>"}]}